<title>USA: Specialty Teleconstructors redeems warrant.</title>
<headline>Specialty Teleconstructors redeems warrant.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR CREST, N.M. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Specialty Teleconstructors Inc said on Thursday that it intends to redeem all outstanding redeemable common stock purchase warrants on March 26, 1997.</p>
</text>
